{
  "$introduce": "序章、第一章与第三章爱丽丝段落：ch0_prologue 序章、ch1_alice 带教、ch3_alice 中期考核、ch3_alice_boss 考核结算",
  "theme": "skyfootspa:alice_margatroid1",
  "isPause": false,
  "dialogues": {
    "ch0_prologue": [
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "喂喂喂，清醒了吗？能听见我说话吗？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "LOOK_AROUND_HOP"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "呃……按照说明书，唤醒流程应该没错啊。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "？？？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_confuse",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……我来看看，“若出现故障请前往畜生界灵长园联系埴安神袿姬”。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "HOP"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不仅不包邮费还要我自己把东西搬过去吗？不如自己解决了。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_angry",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "既然我对这种构造不是很熟，那就试试土办法好了。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "scale": 2.6
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "听魔理沙说，对于大多数设备，只要敲一下就会变好。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "scale": 2.6
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "停停停停停停"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "哎呀，原来没坏吗。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_flowers",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "呃，刚刚头还有点晕，能不能劳烦您先把大锤收起来。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_flowers",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "啊……不好意思，我刚刚还以为你需要维修，没吓着你吧。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_sweat",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "SQUAT"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这真的算是维修吗？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_sweat",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以这位小姐，能不能问一下现在是什么情况？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_sweat",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我似乎什么也不知道。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_sweat",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "没有写入初始状态设定吗……埴安神女士真是……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那就先从我的自我介绍开始吧。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "HOP"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我的名字是爱丽丝·玛格特罗伊德，是居住在魔法森林的魔法使，严格来说是人偶师。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "而你呢，是一个土偶，简单来说应该是类似于仿生人和机器人之类的……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这种词你应该还听的懂吧，我不知道你的知识库储备怎么样。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "大致能听得懂。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ],
        "sound": "minecraft:entity.player.levelup"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "有一位朋友将你制作出来并送给了我，"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不过由于我用自制的人偶已经成习惯了，收到后就一直堆在仓库里。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "简单的来说，我是你的主人，而你是我的下属。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那你现在把我掏出来是有什么活要我干吗？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "是的，我来到这个幻想乡已经有些年头了，这片与外界隔绝的桃花源，确实如同它的名字般梦幻。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "SQUAT"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "但在这平和温馨的日常下，总是潜藏着浑浊的污秽。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "最令人痛心的是，很多人对此淡然地接受了，任由这种陈腐的黑暗不断生根发芽。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_angry",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "HOP"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "而我已经无法继续忍受了。于是现在，我要对幻想乡进行一场彻底的创新性变革。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_angry",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "为此，我需要更多人手的协助。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines"
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你是我能想到的最佳人选，请务必借给我你的力量。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines"
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "难道你是想……造反？！"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines",
            "animation": "LINES_SHAKE",
            "loop": true
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ],
        "sound": "minecraft:block.anvil.land"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以，我现在命你为洗脚城大店长，统率全城。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines"
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "然后把这家足浴店打造成全幻想乡人尽皆知的超人气品牌！"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines"
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "幻想乡崭新的未来就靠你了！"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines"
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "scale": 2.6
          },
          "names"
        ],
        "sound": "minecraft:entity.villager.celebrate"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70,
            "scale": 2.6
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我好像不是很懂你想表达什么。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "展开来说就是，这片土地被称为幻想乡，与外界不同，是充斥着幻想的世界。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "随着人类的发展，许多存在——比如妖怪逐渐式微，而这里就是接纳他们的地方。换句话说，幻想乡是为他们提供的避风港。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "但关键在于，隔绝幻想乡与外界的“博丽大结界”是于明治年间升起的。在此之后，两边就无法随意往来。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "而幻想乡里也是有人类存在的。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以现在幻想乡内的人类聚落——人间之里还大体保留着明治时期乡间的风貌和生活习俗。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "SQUAT"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "也就是说，幻想乡的卫生状态以外界的现代标准来看有点不达标。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "于是，就需要我来掀起一场轰轰烈烈的讲卫生树新风行动！"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines"
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "HOP"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "原来前面的污秽指的是字面意义上的卫生问题吗！"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines",
            "animation": "LINES_SHAKE",
            "loop": true
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ],
        "sound": "minecraft:block.anvil.land"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那为什么是足浴店，正常情况下不是应该开澡堂或者卖卫浴用品又或当水管工加装自来水管道吗？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "呃……因为这里其实还有另一个问题。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_sweat",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不知道怎么回事，也不知道是谁先开的头，有一股……令人尴尬的流言正在传播。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "SQUAT"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "什么流言？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "……是说幻想乡里的人都不怎么洗脚，所以幻想乡里的美少女脚都很臭……"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以真的很臭吗？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_sullen",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你要不用你的鼻子来自己确认一下？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_angry",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "HOP"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不用了，像你这样的美少女，脚一定是如同盛开的花朵般芬芳，"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_angry",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "我怕一闻就陶醉于其中无法自拔了。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_close_eyes_angry",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "总之，要是给我捉到是谁在散布这种谣言，我绝对要把他钉在魔法森林的树上让他瘴气吸到饱。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "不过现在既然抓不到人，就只能用其他方式来解决这个谣言了。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "靠开洗脚店？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "没错，足浴店！"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "speed_lines"
          },
          {
            "id": "alice_flowers",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "HOP"
          },
          "names"
        ],
        "sound": "minecraft:entity.player.levelup"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "这可是我好不容易才想出来的完美方案，既能改善幻想乡里的卫生条件，又能展现我们非常在乎个人卫生，甚至能促进经济发展。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ],
        "sound": "minecraft:entity.villager.celebrate"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "简直是一举两得……不对是三得。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "（这种做法……怎么感觉有种此地无银三百两的既视感）"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以就让我来经营这家足浴店吗？"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_raise_eyebrow",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "没错，毕竟我自己的人偶都是需要我手动操纵的，而我现在又有其它事要做，"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_flowers",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "TALK"
          },
          "names"
        ],
        "sound": "minecraft:entity.player.levelup"
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "所以还是作为土偶可以自主行动的你更加适合。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_flowers",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "那行吧，毕竟在我的立场上也没有拒绝的能力。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_flowers",
            "animation": "NOT_TALK",
            "brightness": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
          "text": "你也别想的这么悲观了，如果你高标准地完成了工作的话，我肯定不会亏待你。"
        },
        "portrait": [
          {
            "id": "alice_grin_eyebrow",
            "renderOrder": 10,
            "replace": true,
            "animation": "HOP"
          },
          "names"
        ]
      },
      {
        "dialogBox": {
